{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:48 2026-10-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:48 2026-10-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:48 2026-10-01 HKT</p><img alt=\"「嘉應耀昇」賀廄中三元\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/b917ff0d7e20cc953a0fb6dd74e111bd/2026-10/55533333.jpg\"/><p>今日沙田第五場四班一千米直路賽，焦點落在兩匹質新馬「星球勇士」及「嘉應耀昇」身上，果然兩駒半程便開始單打獨鬥，接着終點前「嘉應耀昇」拋離「星球勇士」兩馬位勝出，賀賢連中三元，並以三十六分在練馬師王積分表上領先。</p><p>賀賢連中三元，「嘉應耀昇」上季一出即勝，今日季內初出，成功取得跨季連捷。</p><p>賽後賀賢說：「『嘉應耀昇』是一匹令人期待及興奮的賽駒，在港兩戰兩勝，表現出色，由於今天天氣非常熱，場地很乾快，所以馬兒今仗跑出快時間。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94903a19a650511f77341c899583621e/2026-10/1b6cc5cb-34f0-405c-8686-53239c8fe304.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/181534ce6843c4a3171fc5924a6486e0/2026-10/7c485ccc-775b-46f3-821e-dad0aed86314.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/daaf504316b1c0cae10f55f5acd640a5/2026-10/8df59a0b-c219-4698-823b-ab3d0c5c25c7.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c8c87d20faba80cedef0df9573211c8/2026-10/38c8ef77-9785-4cef-b075-4dec2fcd7b1b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f45fdd36027fb006923146b36a61a085/2026-10/52582de3-5548-41da-8434-b845491a4c6e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bc294a98585079974e1e87da14f24b8/2026-10/5767714f-7b71-4c1e-bf3f-889e3dfbfee8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3052a6a3ce98195cad0fc5acd32db33/2026-10/66637118-fc8a-4ec3-99f1-085f9653708f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af60f161753a61d39cafb0c5c54182d4/2026-10/a69277bc-5dbe-4e7d-928a-1b29d8b3878b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7dc6c499b9973bbb661f62b2f6c05518/2026-10/c7821045-892f-48f5-808b-0fda7a3cc170.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8abba1e3830e8a78b707bed0fffa2a4c/2026-10/e065c956-b13f-47ae-b0d8-2e9ba85d397c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/239a698e70fb376e9e279becc